      "writtenOn": "2019-08-28T05:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  Using one of these implies that system image can rely on it \ncorrect.\n\n\u003e so must be made available by all vendors??\nNot really, they only need to make those heaps available that are used by their system image, so definitely not expecting all 8 CMA heaps to be present all the times.\nAndroid (AOSP) will only use standard heap ids as defined in the \u0027enum ion_heap_id\u0027 below ( if at all). I will add a comment to that end below.",
